  },
  "body": "In `ConnectionUtil.reset`, we initialize a `KeyManagerFactory` with a null `KeyStore`, requesting the platform-default key source. RVSec reports the call because its rule requires a generated `KeyStore`, and loading the default source was not observed.\n\nI removed the initialization and its import. This is safe because the factory\u2019s key managers were never retrieved or installed.\n\nI found this while running the app under RVSec, a runtime checker for how apps use the Java crypto and TLS APIs.\n\nThe project builds with this change (`assembleDebug`).\n\nI'm a Computer Engineering student at the University of Bras\u00edlia (UnB), working on a research project on Android app analysis. Happy to adjust this to the project's conventions.",
